# conformance/gram/010/indentation.lo
# covers: GRAM-010, GRAM-011, GRAM-012, GRAM-013, GRAM-014, GRAM-015
#lingua: EN

# Indentation is leading U+0020 SPACE only. Other whitespace at line start rejected (L0510).
# Blank/comment lines invisible to indentation tracker.
# First logical line base indentation MUST be zero (L0511).
# Indentation mismatch rejected (L0512). DEDENT per level at EOF.
# Tabs inside lines/comments/strings are fine.

function main() returns Unit:
    if true then:
        return Unit